      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Explains the two types of evidence considered: effectiveness evidence from randomized trials and other controlled studies, and qualitative evidence on acceptability, feasibility and implementation. It notes that cost evidence came only from included studies and programme documents, and describes an overarching analysis of cross-cutting factors from qualitative reviews and other syntheses.",
